            "review_title": "Review at Ruby",
            "review_text": "Vino\n2 contributions\n0\nWine dîner with french cooking excellence\nMay 2023 • Business\nWine dîner with the wines from Château Laroze, Grand cru Classé of Saint-Emilion. Pierre Meneau did a magnificent dîner, savory and creative. We discovered new mariages of flavors and textures on each dish for the pleasure of our palates. The pairing with te wines was excellent. He also has a good selection of french wines. A must !\nWritten June 1, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
