            "review_title": "Review at Ruby",
            "review_text": "cebolzappa\nIndonesia824 contributions\n0\nFine place & Decent Price\nDec 2017 • Friends\nOne of my team member has an early flight the next day for his year end vacation so we decided to have a year end dinner here. He took us to vinhomes area which is nothing like old quarter, it is a modern, wide, not crowded residential area with its own malls and restaurants \nAnyway, after walked around we went to ruby. We were the only guest at that time, greeted with hospitality. We shared our orders that consist of a beef tartare, greek salad, rib eye giant (400gr), sea bass fillet, 2 french fries, and asparagus. \nWe brought our own wine (a compliment from the Apartment management; it’s not that good but alas it is free- no corkage fee in ruby and they even open it and prepared and poured it to us as we ordered)\nWe got complimentary basket of bread n butter and also mineral water which is great\nIt is a nice place if you want a different vibe from old quarter/ hanoi experience. The staffs are helping and nice, The place is decent, food presentation is amazing, and taste okay (not extraordinary). But anyway the reason i gave a very good review is because price wise it is cheap. Among for 4 us, include vat and tax cost around 2.1 VND for the dishes i mentioned above, so each of us chip in 500++ each which is cheap for that kind of restaurant, service, and presentation in my humble opinion\nRead more\nWritten December 22, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
